      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹10.09 (down from ₹12.95 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹3.87b (up 6.3% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹1.82b (down 22% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 47% (down from 64% in FY 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 65% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 8% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
